# This repo is a Unity *package*, not a Unity project — so there is no Library/,
# Temp/, obj/, or Build/ to ignore under normal use. Keep .meta files tracked:
# Unity needs them and they carry the asset GUIDs consumers rely on.

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.bak
# NOTE: do not add "*~" here — it would match Unity's Documentation~ and Samples~
# folders, which are hidden from the Editor but MUST be committed to git.

# IDE
.vs/
.idea/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user

# If you ever open this folder AS a project for testing, ignore the generated dirs:
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]serSettings/
